    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d165-a5">

                <pb facs="0427" n="331" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg331"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram No. 117.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Amoy</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-08-07T11:50:00+08:05">7, 8, 1874, 11.50 <hi
                                rendition="#italic">a.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Seward</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Shanghai:</hi></p>
                <p>Le Gendre wishes me to send him to Shanghai.</p>
                <closer><signed>HENDERSON.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <opener><dateline rendition="#float-left">Answered <date calendar="gregorian"
                                when="1874-08-08">August 8, 1874</date>:</dateline></opener>
                    <p>Le Gendre’s request appears reasonable. In case you send him, send all
                        possible evidence and Williams’s dispatches.</p>
                    <closer><signed>SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
